Article 4 (Relationship with Other Statutes) Where another statute cites the former Culture and Arts Promotion Act as at the time this Act enters into force, and this Act contains a corresponding provision, that citation shall be deemed to refer to this Act or the corresponding provision of this Act in place of the former provision.

