In Article 6-2 (1), “the Special Metropolitan City, Metropolitan Cities, the Special Self-Governing City, Dos and the Special Self-Governing Province” is replaced with “the Special Metropolitan City, Integrated Special Metropolitan Cities, Metropolitan Cities, the Special Self-Governing City, Dos and the Special Self-Governing Province”.
In Article 15 (2), “the Special Metropolitan City Mayor, a Metropolitan City Mayor, or a Do Governor” is replaced with “the Special Metropolitan City Mayor, an Integrated Special Metropolitan City Mayor, a Metropolitan City Mayor, or a Do Governor”.
In the introductory part of Article 18 (1), “a large city with a population of at least 500,000, excluding the Seoul Special Metropolitan City and Metropolitan Cities, under Article 198 of the Local Autonomy Act” is replaced with “a large city with a population of at least 500,000 under Article 198 (1) of the Local Autonomy Act”.
Paragraph <32> Omitted.
